    "summary": "When you spend a token through Power From Pain, check the recipient’s distance from the Cronos unit. Roll a D6 if you Empowered a friendly unit at most 9″ away. Add 1 if any model in the Cronos unit lacks a Spirit Vortex. On 5+, put one Pain token back in the army pool. Spending a token for any other reason gives no roll. Overlapping copies of the aura give one roll for the same spend.",
